{% comment %}
  Overrides the Directus system template of the same name (English, Directus
  design). Lives on the instance in EMAIL_TEMPLATES_PATH (/directus/templates);
  this copy is the source of truth — see docs/directus.md.

  Data: url, email + projectName, projectColor, projectUrl. The
  subject line is the hardcoded English "You've been invited" (Directus
  api/src/services/users.ts) and cannot be set from here.

  The logo is a hardcoded absolute URL, not `projectLogo`: the instance has no
  project_logo and no PUBLIC_URL, so that variable renders as a relative path
  (broken in e-mail) pointing at the white Directus logo.

  Deliberately standalone: the system `base` layout carries an English footer
  and signature.
{% endcomment %}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="cs">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow" />
    <title>Pozvánka – {{ projectName }}</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important; background-color: #ffe8d6">
    <div style="display: none; max-height: 0; max-width: 0; opacity: 0; overflow: hidden">
      Pozvánku přijmete nastavením hesla.
    </div>

    <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse; background-color: #ffe8d6">
      <tr>
        <td align="center" valign="top" style="padding: 32px 16px">
          <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 560px">
            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="padding-bottom: 24px">
                <img src="https://www.jedlik-nejedlik.cz/512.icon.png" alt="{{ projectName }}" width="64" height="64" style="display: block; width: 64px; height: 64px; border: 0; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: contain" />
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; padding: 40px 32px; font-family: 'Poppins', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: #22284f">
                <h1 style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; font-weight: 700; color: #0a1a57">
                  Máte pozvánku
                </h1>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0">
                  Někdo vás pozval do Jedlíka-nejedlíka. Pozvánku přijmete kliknutím na tlačítko níž.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 28px 0">
                  <strong>Účet zatím není aktivní.</strong> Aktivuje se hned po nastavení hesla.
                </p>

                <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td align="center" bgcolor="#0a1a57" style="border-radius: 999px">
                      <a href="{{ url }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank" style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 32px; font-family: 'Poppins', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 999px">
                        Přijmout pozvánku
                      </a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <p style="margin: 28px 0 8px 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #4a5178">
                  Tlačítko nefunguje? Zkopírujte si tento odkaz do prohlížeče:
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-all">
                  <a href="{{ url }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank" style="color: #0a1a57">{{ url }}</a>
                </p>

                <hr style="margin: 32px 0 20px 0; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #e2e6f2" />

                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #6b7194">
                  Tuto zprávu jsme poslali, protože někdo pozval adresu
                  <strong style="color: #4a5178">{{ email }}</strong>. Pokud jste to nečekali,
                  nemusíte dělat nic, stačí e-mail smazat.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="padding: 24px 8px 0 8px; font-family: 'Poppins', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #4a5178">
                <a href="https://www.jedlik-nejedlik.cz" target="_blank" style="color: #0a1a57; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600">Jedlík-nejedlík</a>
                – Výživa a&nbsp;výchova v&nbsp;propojení
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
